// socket_status() is unavailable on this driver build (no `sockets`
// package -- e.g. the WASM build, where real network sockets don't make
// sense in a browser sandbox), so it's not just absent at runtime but
// undefined at COMPILE time -- any reference to it fails the whole file's
// (and therefore this whole simul_efun object's) compile. These three
// helpers are diagnostic/admin-tool utilities only (netstat, i3router,
// http client status), not part of the boot/login path, so they're
// neutered to no-ops rather than preserving partial behavior.
string dump_socket_status() {
    return "";
}

mixed *socket_names(){
    return ({});
}

string socket_ip(int fd){
    return "0";
}
